abstract: "A practitioner's handbook across network, wireless, web, API, cloud and directory assessment, based on NIST SP 800-115, PTES, OWASP and MITRE ATT&CK, with worked scenarios, a protocol and attack reference and the full specification of the open-source PostureKit host assessment toolkit."
